      "category": "Counting",
      "pl": "Pięć",
      "en": "Five",
      "level": 5.1,
      "emoji": "5️⃣",
      "note": "From 5 up, the noun goes into genitive plural: pięć złotych, pięć godzin."
    },
    {
      "id": "5.1-06",
      "category": "Counting",
      "pl": "Dziesięć",
      "en": "Ten",
      "level": 5.1,
      "emoji": "🔟",
      "note": "Pronounced roughly 'dzhye-shownch'; same genitive plural rule: dziesięć euro, dziesięć minut."
